# Deployment

## Belle (this repo default)

- **Production URL:** https://belle-todos.vercel.app/
- **Vercel project:** `belle-todos`
- **Deploy command:**
  ```bash
  npx vercel deploy --prod --yes
  ```
- After deploy, confirm the alias points at production:
  ```bash
  npx vercel alias set <deployment-url> belle-todos.vercel.app
  ```
- Do **not** use `to-dos-kappa-steel.vercel.app` or other legacy aliases as Belle's production URL.

## Rod (same codebase, separate Vercel project)

- **Production URL:** https://rod-todos.vercel.app/
- **Vercel project:** `rod-todos`
- **Deploy command:**
  ```bash
  npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --project rod-todos
  ```

## Deploy both

```bash
npx vercel deploy --prod --yes && npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --project rod-todos
```

Both projects share this GitHub repo (`main`). Pushing to `main` may auto-deploy, but always verify Belle lands on **belle-todos.vercel.app**.
